=3D"1278" data-end=3D"1286">params</code> + <code data-start=3D"1289" data-=
end=3D"1304">debt_template</code> from legacy_v12.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1714">
<p data-start=3D"1324" data-end=3D"1343">For each iteration:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1346" data-end=3D"1714">
<li data-start=3D"1346" data-end=3D"1423">
<p data-start=3D"1348" data-end=3D"1423">Applies sampled <code data-start=
=3D"1364" data-end=3D"1381">capacity_factor</code> and <code data-start=3D"=
1386" data-end=3D"1395">fx_depr</code> into a <code data-start=3D"1403" dat=
a-end=3D"1422">ProjectParameters</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1426" data-end=3D"1479">
<p data-start=3D"1428" data-end=3D"1479">Validates (<code data-start=3D"143=
9" data-end=3D"1468">validate_project_parameters</code>) if asked.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1482" data-end=3D"1569">
<p data-start=3D"1484" data-end=3D"1569">Computes <code data-start=3D"1493"=
 data-end=3D"1505">total_debt</code>, USD/LKR split, and injects sampled ra=
tes into <code data-start=3D"1553" data-end=3D"1568">DebtStructure</code>.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1572" data-end=3D"1626">
<p data-start=3D"1574" data-end=3D"1626">Calls <code data-start=3D"1580" da=
ta-end=3D"1612">build_financial_model(p, debt)</code> (v12 engine).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1629" data-end=3D"1714">
<p data-start=3D"1631" data-end=3D"1640">Collects:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1645" data-end=3D"1714">
<li data-start=3D"1645" data-end=3D"1659">
<p data-start=3D"1647" data-end=3D"1659"><code data-start=3D"1647" data-end=
=3D"1659">equity_irr</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1664" data-end=3D"1679">
<p data-start=3D"1666" data-end=3D"1679"><code data-start=3D"1666" data-end=
=3D"1679">project_irr</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1684" data-end=3D"1697">
<p data-start=3D"1686" data-end=3D"1697"><code data-start=3D"1686" data-end=
=3D"1697">npv_12pct</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1702" data-end=3D"1714">
<p data-start=3D"1704" data-end=3D"1714"><code data-start=3D"1704" data-end=
=3D"1714">min_dscr</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1715" data-end=3D"1889">
<p data-start=3D"1717" data-end=3D"1731">On completion:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1734" data-end=3D"1889">
<li data-start=3D"1734" data-end=3D"1771">
<p data-start=3D"1736" data-end=3D"1771">Returns a <code data-start=3D"1746=
" data-end=3D"1757">DataFrame</code> of scenarios.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1774" data-end=3D"1889">
<p data-start=3D"1776" data-end=3D"1781">Adds:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1786" data-end=3D"1889">
<li data-start=3D"1786" data-end=3D"1805">
<p data-start=3D"1788" data-end=3D"1805"><code data-start=3D"1788" data-end=
=3D"1805">mean_equity_irr</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1810" data-end=3D"1828">
<p data-start=3D"1812" data-end=3D"1828"><code data-start=3D"1812" data-end=
=3D"1828">p10_equity_irr</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1833" data-end=3D"1851">
<p data-start=3D"1835" data-end=3D"1851"><code data-start=3D"1835" data-end=
=3D"1851">p90_equity_irr</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1856" data-end=3D"1889">
<p data-start=3D"1858" data-end=3D"1889"><code data-start=3D"1858" data-end=
=3D"1872">success_rate</code><br>
as <code data-start=3D"1878" data-end=3D"1888">df.attrs</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1891" data-end=3D"2003">So far, that=E2=80=99s a perfectly=
 usable <strong data-start=3D"1925" data-end=3D"1945">legacy MC engine</str=
ong>, albeit tightly coupled to v12 and its parameter objects.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2005" data-end=3D"2050">B. The =E2=80=9Ctest shim=E2=80=
=9D that nukes all of that</h3>
