<p data-start=3D"2351" data-end=3D"2362">Key points:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2364" data-end=3D"2789">
<li data-start=3D"2364" data-end=3D"2473">
<p data-start=3D"2366" data-end=3D"2394"><strong data-start=3D"2366" data-e=
nd=3D"2393">Function name collision</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2397" data-end=3D"2473">
<li data-start=3D"2397" data-end=3D"2437">
<p data-start=3D"2399" data-end=3D"2437"><code data-start=3D"2399" data-end=
=3D"2423">generate_mc_parameters</code> is redefined.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2440" data-end=3D"2473">
<p data-start=3D"2442" data-end=3D"2473"><code data-start=3D"2442" data-end=
=3D"2459">run_monte_carlo</code> is redefined.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2474" data-end=3D"2596">
<p data-start=3D"2476" data-end=3D"2505">New <code data-start=3D"2480" data=
-end=3D"2504">generate_mc_parameters</code>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2508" data-end=3D"2596">
<li data-start=3D"2508" data-end=3D"2596">
<p data-start=3D"2510" data-end=3D"2596">Just returns a list of dicts with =
<code data-start=3D"2544" data-end=3D"2566">"tariff_lkr_per_kwh"</code> ste=
pping from <code data-start=3D"2581" data-end=3D"2587">base</code> upwards.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2597" data-end=3D"2789">
<p data-start=3D"2599" data-end=3D"2621">New <code data-start=3D"2603" data=
-end=3D"2620">run_monte_carlo</code>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2624" data-end=3D"2789">
<li data-start=3D"2624" data-end=3D"2675">
<p data-start=3D"2626" data-end=3D"2675">Pure stub: no financial model, no =
debt structure.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2678" data-end=3D"2732">
<p data-start=3D"2680" data-end=3D"2732">Computes a fake IRR curve from <co=
de data-start=3D"2711" data-end=3D"2731">tariff_lkr_per_kwh</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2735" data-end=3D"2789">
<p data-start=3D"2737" data-end=3D"2789">Returns <code data-start=3D"2745" =
data-end=3D"2788">{"inputs": overrides, "results": results}</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2791" data-end=3D"2992">So at import time, the <strong dat=
a-start=3D"2814" data-end=3D"2843">stub completely overrides</strong> the r=
eal MC implementation. This is clearly something we built earlier as a <str=
ong data-start=3D"2920" data-end=3D"2948">lightweight test harness</strong>=
, and then parked at the bottom of the file.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2994" data-end=3D"3114">Conclusion: <strong data-start=3D"=
3006" data-end=3D"3075">there is no usable =E2=80=9Creal=E2=80=9D Monte Car=
lo left in this file right now</strong> =E2=80=93 only the stub is actually=
 reachable.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3119">
<h2 data-start=3D"3121" data-end=3D"3150">2. What this means for v14</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3152" data-end=3D"3169">For v14, we want:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3171" data-end=3D"3852">
<li data-start=3D"3171" data-end=3D"3206">
<p data-start=3D"3173" data-end=3D"3206">Zero dependency on <code data-star=
t=3D"3192" data-end=3D"3205">.legacy_v12</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3207" data-end=3D"3272">
<p data-start=3D"3209" data-end=3D"3272">No object-style <code data-start=
=3D"3225" data-end=3D"3244">ProjectParameters</code> / <code data-start=3D"=
3247" data-end=3D"3262">DebtStructure</code> from v12.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3273" data-end=3D"3560">
<p data-start=3D"3275" data-end=3D"3309">Respect the <strong data-start=3D"=
3287" data-end=3D"3308">v14 config schema</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3312" data-end=3D"3560">
<li data-start=3D"3312" data-end=3D"3413">
<p data-start=3D"3314" data-end=3D"3413">Everything hangs off YAML/JSON con=
figs loaded via <code data-start=3D"3364" data-end=3D"3412">analytics.scena=
rio_loader.load_scenario_config</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3416" data-end=3D"3560">
<p data-start=3D"3418" data-end=3D"3560">Schema enforcement via <code data-=
start=3D"3441" data-end=3D"3489">analytics.schema_guard.validate_config_for=
_v14</code> (or whatever you named it) with <code data-start=3D"3522" data-=
end=3D"3559">modules=3D["cashflow", "debt", "irr"]</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3561" data-end=3D"3728">
<p data-start=3D"3563" data-end=3D"3611">Re-use the <em data-start=3D"3574"=
 data-end=3D"3580">same</em> pipeline the lender flow uses:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3614" data-end=3D"3728">
<li data-start=3D"3614" data-end=3D"3641">
<p data-start=3D"3616" data-end=3D"3641"><code data-start=3D"3616" data-end=
=3D"3635">build_annual_rows</code> (v14)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3644" data-end=3D"3664">
<p data-start=3D"3646" data-end=3D"3664"><code data-start=3D"3646" data-end=
=3D"3664">apply_debt_layer</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3667" data-end=3D"3728">
<p data-start=3D"3669" data-end=3D"3728"><code data-start=3D"3669" data-end=
=3D"3694">calculate_scenario_kpis</code> (or the v14 metrics entry point).<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3729" data-end=3D"3852">
<p data-start=3D"3731" data-end=3D"3750">Keep IRR/NPV rules:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3753" data-end=3D"3852">
<li data-start=3D"3753" data-end=3D"3792">
<p data-start=3D"3755" data-end=3D"3792">IRR/NPV <strong data-start=3D"3763=
" data-end=3D"3791">only in <code data-start=3D"3773" data-end=3D"3789">fin=
ance/irr.py</code></strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3795" data-end=3D"3852">
<p data-start=3D"3797" data-end=3D"3852">Metrics modules just orchestrate, =
not re-implement IRR.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3854" data-end=3D"3973">Also: we absolutely do <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3877" data-end=3D"3884">not</strong> want a core library module =
that silently redefines itself via a test shim at the bottom.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3975" data-end=3D"3978">
<h2 data-start=3D"3980" data-end=3D"4050">3. Strategy: leave <code data-sta=
rt=3D"4002" data-end=3D"4018">monte_carlo.py</code> alone, build a fresh v1=
4 module</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4052" data-end=3D"4130">Given how embedded this stub proba=
bly is in existing tests, the clean move is:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4132" data-end=3D"4257">
