g_path, modules=3D["cashflow", "debt", "irr"])</code> (respecting <code dat=
a-start=3D"4978" data-end=3D"4995">validation_mode</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5000" data-end=3D"5295">
<p data-start=3D"5003" data-end=3D"5026">Generate random shocks:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5032" data-end=3D"5295">
<li data-start=3D"5032" data-end=3D"5094">
<p data-start=3D"5034" data-end=3D"5094">Debt ratio (within sensible bounds=
 from schema or defaults).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5100" data-end=3D"5142">
<p data-start=3D"5102" data-end=3D"5142">FX depreciation (within allowed bo=
unds).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5148" data-end=3D"5191">
<p data-start=3D"5150" data-end=3D"5191">Capacity factor (or annual energy =
yield).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5197" data-end=3D"5295">
<p data-start=3D"5199" data-end=3D"5295">Possibly rate shocks (spreads on b=
ase rates) if the debt structure is expressed that way in v14.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5298" data-end=3D"5898">
<p data-start=3D"5301" data-end=3D"5325">For each simulation <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5321" data-end=3D"5324">i</code>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5331" data-end=3D"5898">
<li data-start=3D"5331" data-end=3D"5355">
<p data-start=3D"5333" data-end=3D"5355">Clone the base config.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5361" data-end=3D"5491">
<p data-start=3D"5363" data-end=3D"5491">Apply scenario-specific overrides =
(e.g. <code data-start=3D"5403" data-end=3D"5415">debt_ratio</code>, <code =
data-start=3D"5417" data-end=3D"5426">fx_depr</code>, <code data-start=3D"5=
428" data-end=3D"5445">capacity_factor</code>, maybe <code data-start=3D"54=
53" data-end=3D"5470">usd_rate_spread</code>, <code data-start=3D"5472" dat=
a-end=3D"5489">lkr_rate_spread</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5497" data-end=3D"5707">
<p data-start=3D"5499" data-end=3D"5503">Run:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5511" data-end=3D"5707">
<li data-start=3D"5511" data-end=3D"5553">
<p data-start=3D"5513" data-end=3D"5553"><code data-start=3D"5513" data-end=
=3D"5553">annual_rows =3D build_annual_rows(cfg_i)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5561" data-end=3D"5613">
<p data-start=3D"5563" data-end=3D"5613"><code data-start=3D"5563" data-end=
=3D"5613">debt_rows =3D apply_debt_layer(cfg_i, annual_rows)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5621" data-end=3D"5707">
<p data-start=3D"5623" data-end=3D"5707"><code data-start=3D"5623" data-end=
=3D"5707">summary_df, timeseries_df =3D calculate_scenario_kpis(cfg_i, annu=
al_rows, debt_rows)</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5713" data-end=3D"5852">
<p data-start=3D"5715" data-end=3D"5741">Extract from <code data-start=3D"5=
728" data-end=3D"5740">summary_df</code>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5749" data-end=3D"5852">
<li data-start=3D"5749" data-end=3D"5778">
<p data-start=3D"5751" data-end=3D"5778"><code data-start=3D"5751" data-end=
=3D"5764">project_irr</code>, <code data-start=3D"5766" data-end=3D"5778">e=
quity_irr</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5786" data-end=3D"5832">
<p data-start=3D"5788" data-end=3D"5832"><code data-start=3D"5788" data-end=
=3D"5801">npv_project</code> (or your canonical NPV column)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5840" data-end=3D"5852">
<p data-start=3D"5842" data-end=3D"5852"><code data-start=3D"5842" data-end=
=3D"5852">dscr_min</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
