<ul data-start=3D"2704" data-end=3D"2930">
<li data-start=3D"2704" data-end=3D"2772">
<p data-start=3D"2706" data-end=3D"2772">Accepts scalar <code data-start=3D=
"2721" data-end=3D"2725">fx</code> again (<code data-start=3D"2733" data-en=
d=3D"2770">if isinstance(fx_cfg, (int, float))</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2775" data-end=3D"2862">
<p data-start=3D"2777" data-end=3D"2862">Mapping uses: <code data-start=3D"=
2791" data-end=3D"2808">annual_depr_pct</code> or <code data-start=3D"2812"=
 data-end=3D"2822">depr_pct</code> (percent), NOT <code data-start=3D"2838"=
 data-end=3D"2851">annual_depr</code> (decimal).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2865" data-end=3D"2930">
<p data-start=3D"2867" data-end=3D"2930">Legacy nested branch uses <code da=
ta-start=3D"2893" data-end=3D"2910">annual_depr_pct</code>, not <code data-=
start=3D"2916" data-end=3D"2929">annual_depr</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2932" data-end=3D"2945">So right now:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2947" data-end=3D"3162">
<li data-start=3D"2947" data-end=3D"3162">
<p data-start=3D"2949" data-end=3D"3013">A YAML with <code data-start=3D"29=
61" data-end=3D"3012">fx: { start_lkr_per_usd: 375, annual_depr: 0.03 }</co=
de>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3016" data-end=3D"3162">
<li data-start=3D"3016" data-end=3D"3055">
<p data-start=3D"3018" data-end=3D"3055">Passes loader / <code data-start=
=3D"3034" data-end=3D"3047">_resolve_fx</code> tests =E2=9C=85</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3058" data-end=3D"3162">
<p data-start=3D"3060" data-end=3D"3162"><strong data-start=3D"3060" data-e=
nd=3D"3067">BUT</strong> <code data-start=3D"3068" data-end=3D"3079">_fx_cu=
rve</code> will treat <code data-start=3D"3091" data-end=3D"3104">annual_de=
pr</code> as if it doesn=E2=80=99t exist and default to zero depreciation =
=E2=9D=8C</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
