<hr data-start=3D"6966" data-end=3D"6969">
<h3 data-start=3D"6971" data-end=3D"6996">TL;DR / my blunt view</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6998" data-end=3D"7428">
<li data-start=3D"6998" data-end=3D"7186">
<p data-start=3D"7000" data-end=3D"7186">Conceptually, this cashflow module=
 is strong: CFADS definition, BOI holiday, interest shield, statutory layer=
s, risk haircut =E2=80=93 all consistent with the rest of the v14 stack you=
=E2=80=99ve built.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7187" data-end=3D"7428">
<p data-start=3D"7189" data-end=3D"7261">Where it=E2=80=99s weak is <strong=
 data-start=3D"7208" data-end=3D"7260">consistency with your own new =E2=80=
=9Cstrictness=E2=80=9D layer</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7264" data-end=3D"7428">
<li data-start=3D"7264" data-end=3D"7326">
<p data-start=3D"7266" data-end=3D"7326">FX rules (<code data-start=3D"7276=
" data-end=3D"7289">annual_depr</code> vs <code data-start=3D"7293" data-en=
d=3D"7310">annual_depr_pct</code>, scalar <code data-start=3D"7319" data-en=
d=3D"7323">fx</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7329" data-end=3D"7372">
<p data-start=3D"7331" data-end=3D"7372">Project life extraction vs schema =
guard</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7375" data-end=3D"7428">
<p data-start=3D"7377" data-end=3D"7428">Duplicated utils, plus weird self-=
test indentation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7430" data-end=3D"7459">If you want, next step I can:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7461" data-end=3D"7747">
<li data-start=3D"7461" data-end=3D"7747">
<p data-start=3D"7463" data-end=3D"7514">Spit out a <strong data-start=3D"7=
474" data-end=3D"7493">patched version</strong> of this module that:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7517" data-end=3D"7747">
<li data-start=3D"7517" data-end=3D"7573">
<p data-start=3D"7519" data-end=3D"7573">Aligns FX handling with <code data=
-start=3D"7543" data-end=3D"7572">scenario_loader._resolve_fx</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7576" data-end=3D"7631">
<p data-start=3D"7578" data-end=3D"7631">Unifies project life paths with <c=
ode data-start=3D"7610" data-end=3D"7624">schema_guard</code> specs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7634" data-end=3D"7691">
<p data-start=3D"7636" data-end=3D"7691">Centralises <code data-start=3D"76=
48" data-end=3D"7658">as_float</code>/<code data-start=3D"7659" data-end=3D=
"7671">get_nested</code> to <code data-start=3D"7675" data-end=3D"7690">fin=
ance.utils</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7694" data-end=3D"7747">
<p data-start=3D"7696" data-end=3D"7747">Cleans up the bottom self-test / r=
egistration flow.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
