a-end=3D"1550">dscr_min</code> in KPIs and then <code data-start=3D"1568" d=
ata-end=3D"1580">summary_df</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1586" data-end=3D"1749">
<p data-start=3D"1588" data-end=3D"1749">Plenty of useful extras (<code dat=
a-start=3D"1613" data-end=3D"1633">debt_service_total</code>, <code data-st=
art=3D"1635" data-end=3D"1653">debt_outstanding</code>, <code data-start=3D=
"1655" data-end=3D"1671">cfads_extended</code>) that we <em data-start=3D"1=
681" data-end=3D"1688">could</em> surface later in timeseries_df if we want=
 richer DSCR plots.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1753" data-end=3D"1835">So: structurally, this debt module=
 does what ScenarioAnalytics and metrics expect.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1837" data-end=3D"1840">
<h2 data-start=3D"1842" data-end=3D"1901">2. What the module itself is doin=
g (behavioural summary)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1903" data-end=3D"1944">Just to make sure we=E2=80=99re on=
 the same page:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1946" data-end=3D"4029">
<li data-start=3D"1946" data-end=3D"2192">
<p data-start=3D"1948" data-end=3D"1963"><strong data-start=3D"1948" data-e=
nd=3D"1963">Tranche mix</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1966" data-end=3D"2192">
<li data-start=3D"1966" data-end=3D"2051">
<p data-start=3D"1968" data-end=3D"2051">Uses <code data-start=3D"1973" dat=
a-end=3D"1994">Financing_Terms.mix</code> and <code data-start=3D"1999" dat=
a-end=3D"2022">Financing_Terms.rates</code> to allocate LKR / USD / DFI.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2054" data-end=3D"2134">
<p data-start=3D"2056" data-end=3D"2134">Enforces USD minimum (<code data-s=
tart=3D"2078" data-end=3D"2098">usd_commercial_min</code>) by clawing back =
from LKR then DFI.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2137" data-end=3D"2192">
<p data-start=3D"2139" data-end=3D"2192">Shares one <code data-start=3D"215=
0" data-end=3D"2171">interest_only_years</code> across all tranches.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2194" data-end=3D"2568">
<p data-start=3D"2196" data-end=3D"2218"><strong data-start=3D"2196" data-e=
nd=3D"2218">Construction &amp; IDC</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2222" data-end=3D"2568">
<li data-start=3D"2222" data-end=3D"2314">
<p data-start=3D"2224" data-end=3D"2314"><code data-start=3D"2224" data-end=
=3D"2263">calculate_construction_drawdowns(...)</code> allocates drawdowns =
as a percentage of total debt.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2317" data-end=3D"2457">
<p data-start=3D"2319" data-end=3D"2457"><code data-start=3D"2319" data-end=
=3D"2339">calculate_idc(...)</code> accrues interest on the outstanding bal=
ance and capitalizes it during construction (<code data-start=3D"2424" data=
-end=3D"2455">period &lt; construction_periods</code>).</p>
</li>
