<li data-start=3D"2570" data-end=3D"2787">
<p data-start=3D"2572" data-end=3D"2584"><strong data-start=3D"2572" data-e=
nd=3D"2584">Timeline</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2588" data-end=3D"2787">
<li data-start=3D"2588" data-end=3D"2787">
<p data-start=3D"2590" data-end=3D"2623">CFADS extended to <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2608" data-end=3D"2622">23 periods</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2628" data-end=3D"2787">
<li data-start=3D"2628" data-end=3D"2664">
<p data-start=3D"2630" data-end=3D"2664"><code data-start=3D"2630" data-end=
=3D"2652">construction_periods</code> =E2=86=92 CFADS =3D 0</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2669" data-end=3D"2719">
<p data-start=3D"2671" data-end=3D"2719">1 =E2=80=9Ctransition=E2=80=9D per=
iod at 50% of first-year CFADS</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2724" data-end=3D"2741">
<p data-start=3D"2726" data-end=3D"2741">Then full CFADS</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2746" data-end=3D"2787">
<p data-start=3D"2748" data-end=3D"2787">Padded/truncated to exactly 23 ent=
ries.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2789" data-end=3D"3136">
<p data-start=3D"2791" data-end=3D"2804"><strong data-start=3D"2791" data-e=
nd=3D"2804">Schedules</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2808" data-end=3D"3136">
<li data-start=3D"2808" data-end=3D"2869">
<p data-start=3D"2810" data-end=3D"2869">Annuity style: <code data-start=3D=
"2825" data-end=3D"2869">_annuity_schedule(tr, tenor - tr.years_io)</code><=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2872" data-end=3D"3031">
<p data-start=3D"2874" data-end=3D"2889">Sculpted style:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2894" data-end=3D"3031">
<li data-start=3D"2894" data-end=3D"2971">
<p data-start=3D"2896" data-end=3D"2971">Targets DSCR via <code data-start=
=3D"2913" data-end=3D"2952">cfads_extended[construction_periods:]</code> an=
d <code data-start=3D"2957" data-end=3D"2970">target_dscr</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2976" data-end=3D"3031">
<p data-start=3D"2978" data-end=3D"3031">Allocates principal pro-rata to ou=
tstanding balances.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3034" data-end=3D"3136">
<p data-start=3D"3036" data-end=3D"3136">All schedules padded with construc=
tion zeros so DSCR calculation covers the full 23-period timeline.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3138" data-end=3D"3708">
<p data-start=3D"3140" data-end=3D"3148"><strong data-start=3D"3140" data-e=
nd=3D"3148">DSCR</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3152" data-end=3D"3604">
<li data-start=3D"3152" data-end=3D"3345">
<p data-start=3D"3154" data-end=3D"3170">For each period:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3345">
<li data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3230">
<p data-start=3D"3177" data-end=3D"3230">Sum <code data-start=3D"3181" data=
-end=3D"3213">service =3D interest + principal</code> across tranches.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3235" data-end=3D"3345">
<p data-start=3D"3237" data-end=3D"3345">DSCR =3D <code data-start=3D"3244"=
 data-end=3D"3279">cfads_this_period / total_service</code> for periods <st=
rong data-start=3D"3292" data-end=3D"3314">after construction</strong> wher=
e service &gt; 0, else <code data-start=3D"3339" data-end=3D"3344">inf</cod=
e>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
