<li data-start=3D"2296" data-end=3D"2359">
<p data-start=3D"2298" data-end=3D"2359">Enforces the <strong data-start=3D=
"2311" data-end=3D"2353">=E2=80=9Conly <code data-start=3D"2319" data-end=
=3D"2335">finance/irr.py</code> may do IRR/NPV=E2=80=9D</strong> rule.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2360" data-end=3D"2433">
<p data-start=3D"2362" data-end=3D"2433">Gives you <strong data-start=3D"23=
