<li data-start=3D"2434" data-end=3D"2523">
<p data-start=3D"2436" data-end=3D"2523">Keeps metrics as a thin, boring ad=
apter over cashflow+debt+irr (exactly what you want).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2525" data-end=3D"2594">Everything else in those four modu=
les is compatible with this change.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2596" data-end=3D"2655">4. A couple of nits / opinions on=
 the IRR module itself</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2657" data-end=3D"2689">Not blockers, but worth knowing:</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"2691" data-end=3D"3145">
<li data-start=3D"2691" data-end=3D"3020">
<p data-start=3D"2693" data-end=3D"2720">The <code data-start=3D"2697" data=
-end=3D"2714">sys.path.insert</code> hack:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2723" data-end=3D"3020">
<li data-start=3D"2723" data-end=3D"2795">
<p data-start=3D"2725" data-end=3D"2795">It=E2=80=99s handy for running <co=
de data-start=3D"2748" data-end=3D"2756">irr.py</code> directly, but ugly i=
n package context.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2798" data-end=3D"3020">
<p data-start=3D"2800" data-end=3D"3020">If tests run it via <code data-sta=
rt=3D"2820" data-end=3D"2833">finance.irr</code>, the package import path s=
hould make <code data-start=3D"2871" data-end=3D"2886">finance.utils</code>=
 and <code data-start=3D"2891" data-end=3D"2902">constants</code> available=
 without this. So long term, I=E2=80=99d prefer to <strong data-start=3D"29=
55" data-end=3D"2984">drop the <code data-start=3D"2966" data-end=3D"2976">=
sys.path</code> tweak</strong> and rely on proper package imports.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3021" data-end=3D"3145">
<p data-start=3D"3023" data-end=3D"3063"><code data-start=3D"3023" data-end=
=3D"3033">as_float</code> is imported but not used here</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3066" data-end=3D"3145">
<li data-start=3D"3066" data-end=3D"3145">
<p data-start=3D"3068" data-end=3D"3145">Totally harmless, but you can remo=
ve it if you want to keep your lints clean.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3147" data-end=3D"3200">5. Big picture: are the =E2=80=9C=
big three=E2=80=9D coherent now?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3202" data-end=3D"3231">Given the code you=E2=80=99ve past=
