nd debt series =E2=86=92 metrics computes KPIs =E2=86=92 irr is the only pl=
ace where discounting and IRR math live.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"3713" data-end=3D"3762">That=E2=80=99s clean, testable, an=
