<p data-start=3D"4927" data-end=3D"5102">def _calculate_revenue_lkr(net_kwh=
: float, tariff_lkr_per_kwh: float) -&gt; float:<br>
"""Compute revenue in LKR =3D net energy * tariff."""<br>
return net_kwh * tariff_lkr_per_kwh</p>
<p data-start=3D"5105" data-end=3D"5858">def _calculate_statutory_deduction=
s(<br>
revenue_lkr: float,<br>
success_fee_pct: float,<br>
env_surcharge_pct: float,<br>
social_levy_pct: float,<br>
) -&gt; Dict[str, float]:<br>
"""<br>
Calculate statutory charges as percentages of revenue.<br>
Returns a dict with success_fee, environmental_surcharge, social_services_l=
evy, total_statutory_deductions.<br>
"""<br>
success_fee =3D revenue_lkr * success_fee_pct<br>
env_surcharge =3D revenue_lkr * env_surcharge_pct<br>
social_levy =3D revenue_lkr * social_levy_pct<br>
total =3D success_fee + env_surcharge + social_levy<br>
return {<br>
"success_fee": success_fee,<br>
"environmental_surcharge": env_surcharge,<br>
"social_services_levy": social_levy,<br>
"total_statutory_deductions": total,<br>
}</p>
<p data-start=3D"5861" data-end=3D"6041">def _calculate_opex_lkr(opex_usd_p=
er_year: float, fx_rate: float) -&gt; float:<br>
"""Convert annual OPEX from USD to LKR at a given FX rate."""<br>
