<p data-start=3D"6044" data-end=3D"6286">def _apply_risk_haircut(cfads_lkr:=
 float, risk_haircut_pct: float) -&gt; float:<br>
"""<br>
Apply risk haircut: CFADS * (1 - haircut).<br>
