=3D"2304">fail-under=3D65</code> still applies.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2321" data-end=3D"2426">Again: not a functional problem, j=
ust how the coverage gate is wired. Full suite is the true CI analogue.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2428" data-end=3D"2431">
<h2 data-start=3D"2433" data-end=3D"2491">3. Minimal fix: make ScenarioAnal=
ytics skip bad configs</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2493" data-end=3D"2506">What we want:</p>
