d not breaking analytics).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"795" data-end=3D"1014">So from a lender/CI perspective: th=
e v14 stack is now <strong data-start=3D"849" data-end=3D"892">centralised =
under <code data-start=3D"869" data-end=3D"879">finance/</code> and stable<=
/strong>. We haven=E2=80=99t broken the frozen import paths, we haven=E2=80=
=99t upset coverage, and the analytics layer is happily running on top.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1016" data-end=3D"1059">If you=E2=80=99re good with that, =
my honest view:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1653">
<li data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1183">
<p data-start=3D"1063" data-end=3D"1183"><strong data-start=3D"1063" data-e=
