on <code data-start=3D"1124" data-end=3D"1138">cashflow_v14</code>, <code d=
ata-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1150">debt_v14</code>, <code data-start=3D"1=
152" data-end=3D"1157">irr</code> unless we hit a real bug.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1184" data-end=3D"1653">
<p data-start=3D"1186" data-end=3D"1233">Next low-risk niceties (when you f=
eel like it):</p>
