</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1978" data-end=3D"2096">So if anyone =E2=80=9Chelpfully=E2=
=80=9D tries to make that YAML pass without setting corporate_tax_rate prop=
erly, <strong data-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"2095">CI will go red</strong>=
.</p>
</li>
</ol>
